        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability officer for our company's, I can identify several key aspects from our company context that address the sustainability requirements of The solution. our company's has an EcoVadis Silver rating, indicating a robust CSR commitment. our company's have conducted a bilan carbone and have a published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year, which shows our company's dedication to reducing our company's environmental footprint. our company's green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, uses renewable energy, has a low PUE of 1.2, and practices heat reuse, aligning well with the requirement for low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk203> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's digital sobriety practices such as model right-sizing, caching, and batching help minimize energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk204> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, one known CSR tension is the trade-off between high availability and energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk205> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate the trade-off between high availability and energy consumption, our company's must ensure that The solution design balances the trade-off between high availability and energy consumption, possibly by providing transparent information about the premium high-availability configuration's associated footprint, allowing clients to make informed decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk206> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure our company's solution meets all necessary sustainability requirements while minimizing environmental impact: 1. **Carbon Footprint Reporting**: our company's should commit to reporting the carbon footprint of our company's solution to the client, ensuring transparency and accountability. 2. **Sustainable Infrastructure**: Utilize Our green hosting partner, OuraneCloud services for hosting, leveraging Our green hosting partner, OuraneCloud renewable energy and efficient data center practices. 3. **Digital Sobriety**: Implement our company's digital sobriety practices in the design and operation of The solution to minimize unnecessary computational resources and reduce energy consumption. 4. **Energy Efficiency**: Optimize The solution performance to achieve low response times without necessitating overly energy-intensive hardware or configurations, striking a balance between service quality and environmental impact. 5. **Compliance with Sustainable Development Policy**: Ensure that our company's operations and The solution implementation comply with Sustainable Development Policy, integrating sustainability into every phase of the project. 6. **Client Education**: Provide clients with information on how to use The solution in an environmentally friendly manner, including best practices for minimizing energy consumption related to clients usage patterns." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk207> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By addressing best practices for minimizing energy consumption related to their usage patterns, our company's can minimize the CSR risks associated with The solution and ensure that our company's solution not only meets but exceeds the client's sustainability expectations, aligning with our company's values and EcoVadis rating." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk208> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium is pleased to submit a proposal for the artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB). the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) serves the Belval region and has 1200 beds, with a staff count of 4500." ;
